  "body": "Priced for immediate action and positioned in an unbeatable Silverdale location, 24 Johns Creek Crescent is a sun-drenched, three-level terraced home that perfectly blends versatile living with tranquil nature. Backing directly onto a lush, council-managed reserve, this extremely private, north-facing property offers an incredibly rare sense of space and serenity right in the heart of the action. With the vendor highly motivated to sell, this sharply priced opportunity is simply unmissable.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless modern living, you enter the home on the middle level, where a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the vibrant heart of the home. Massive sliding doors bathe the space in all-day sun and open seamlessly onto the first of two private, north-facing decks. Whether you are entertaining guests or enjoying your morning coffee, the lush, uninterrupted reserve outlook provides a stunning daily backdrop.\r\n\r\nThe highly versatile ground floor sets this property apart. Featuring a fully self-contained studio, it utilizes clever sliding doors to separate the living and bedroom zones. Double sliding doors flow out to a second private north-facing deck with direct access to the backyard-making this level the ultimate setup for extended family, a teenage retreat or potential rental income.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the top floor serves as a quiet sanctuary featuring two generous-sized bedrooms and a large, beautifully appointed full family bathroom. The main north-facing bedroom is a true standout, boasting spectacular floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the room with all-day sun and frame a picture-perfect elevated outlook over the reserve.\r\n\r\nBeyond your private reserve oasis, the location is truly unbeatable. You are perfectly positioned close to the local transit hub, motorway access and everyday shops. When the weekend calls, you are just minutes away from the extensive retail offerings of Silverdale Mall and the beautiful shores of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this level of privacy, versatility, and sheer value are exceptionally rare. The vendor's instructions are clear: this property must be sold. Act quickly and contact us today to arrange your private viewing or we look forward to seeing you at the open home!\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\nAddress: 24 Johns Creek Crescent, Silverdale\r\n\r\nLayout: 3-level terraced home with 3 bedrooms and versatile living options\r\n\r\nUnique Feature: Self-contained ground-floor studio with private deck and backyard access\r\n\r\nOutdoor Living: Two private, north-facing decks overlooking a tranquil council-managed reserve\r\n\r\nMiddle Level: Open-plan kitchen, dining and living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n\r\nTop Level: Two generous bedrooms, including a stunning main bedroom with floor-to-ceiling windows for all-day sun and reserve views, plus a large shared bathroom\r\n\r\nLocation: Unbeatable convenience-close to transit hub, motorway, shops, Silverdale Mall and Orewa Beach\r\n\r\nOpportunity: Highly motivated vendor; sharply priced to sell immediately\r\n\r\nContact us for a private viewing or see you at our weekend open homes.",
